translate schinese_rewrite scene_ambleskill_4a9998b0:

    "你不由自主地咽了口唾沫。"

translate schinese_rewrite scene_ambleskill_3cacfca6:

    "安布的肉棒翘起，随后在自身重量作用下落下。那根巨物啪地一下抽在你的脸上。"

translate schinese_rewrite scene_ambleskill_b5a2304a:

    e "嗯……"

